+    // Coefficient-table VRAM base. The cart encodes the table byte address as KTAOF=addr>>18
+    // (attr_dispatch cmd6: ins=(addr>>2)>>16) and KAst=addr<<14, so the decode is KTAOF<<18, not
+    // <<16: Die Hard builds its live 1/z coefficient ramp at VRAM 0x5F200 (KTAOF=1, KAst=0x7C80 ->
